cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this video or its code, please cite it as below.
  For the result itself, cite OpenAI's preprints (listed under references).
type: software
title: >-
  The Haldane Gap, Proved? A Narrated Explainer of the Claimed Proof
  of the Spin-1 Haldane Gap
abstract: >-
  A 24-minute narrated, 3Blue1Brown-style explainer video (manim animations
  with neural-TTS narration) of OpenAI's claimed proof of the spin-1 Haldane
  gap, written for theoretical physicists, together with its script,
  storyboard, scene code and the exact-diagonalization analysis behind every
  plotted number. Script, animations and narration were produced with
  Claude (Anthropic).
authors:
